# Local Vite only. Browser calls Gateway /api/v1/** via src/api/http.ts — never core :8081 or /internal/v1.
# Origin resolution (first accepted value wins):
# 1. Runtime window.__DEALER_GATEWAY_URL__ and/or public/config.json gatewayUrl (Azure can change without rebuild)
# 2. This VITE_GATEWAY_URL (baked at npm/docker build if set)
# 3. Relative '' (same-origin Gateway, typical Azure when SPA and Gateway share the host)
#
# Auth is admin-issued username/password via POST /api/v1/auth/login.
# Design: ../design/15-Data-Auth-and-Gateway.md §8. Set ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD on dealer-core to seed the first account.
#
# Local:
VITE_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:8080
# Azure: leave empty or omit. Do not bake http://localhost:8080 as production.
# Then set public/config.json { "gatewayUrl": "https://<gateway-host>" }
# or inject window.__DEALER_GATEWAY_URL__ before the SPA module.
